		<section>
			<h2>⭐ Favorites</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><em>Altered Carbon</em> series (<em>Broken Angels</em> + <em>Woken Furies</em>) — Richard K. Morgan</li>
				<li><em>Blindsight</em> — Peter Watts</li>
				<li><em>Star Maker</em> — Olaf Stapledon</li>
